# C7, the small render TUs (rendertexture.cpp, ScreenSpaceEffects.cpp, vgui_game_viewport.cpp,
# c_pixel_visibility.cpp, glow_overlay.cpp, warp_overlay.cpp): the frame's engine calls at fixed poses,
# the witness two builds are compared by (run at each and compare the traces' call lines). The render
# targets show in the executor's copies and binds, pixel visibility in the occlusion queries and their
# proxies, the glow overlays in an explosion's fireball flash (a warp overlay, a tenth of a second long,
# so the trace is asked for right after the temp entity is fired and again a frame later), and the
# screen-space effects in the post pass. Two frames at the first pose measure the frame-to-frame noise;
# the map is then loaded again in the same process (the second map load) and the first pose recorded
# once more. Every build carries the recorder; its mesh and occlusion-query hooks are armed by the
# environment, so the dynamic meshes (with their vertices), the bound materials, the clipping switch and
# the query objects are lines too:
#   tools/probes/c0-session OUT tools/probes/sessions/c7-render-small-ab.steps --no-probe-build --port P \
#     --env SOURCESHARP_RENDER_TRACE_MESHES=1
# The fireball's first frames draw nothing (its pixel visibility fades in from 0); a temp entity reaches the
# client a frame or more after it is fired, so the explosion is traced at three delays.
wait managed client module initialized 120
cmd map dm_lockdown
wait first paint 240
sleep 2
cmd sv_cheats 1
cmd cs_sv_showpanel 1 info 0
api teleport pos=-4116,4600,3 ang=0,-90,0 settle=1
sleep 2
cmd cs_cl_render_trace {out}/pose1-a.txt
wait recorded \d+ lines to .*pose1-a 20
cmd cs_cl_render_trace {out}/pose1-b.txt
wait recorded \d+ lines to .*pose1-b 20
shot pose1
cmd cs_te_fire explosion -4116 4400 64
sleep 0.05
cmd cs_cl_render_trace {out}/explosion-a.txt
wait recorded \d+ lines to .*explosion-a 20
sleep 1
cmd cs_te_fire explosion -4116 4400 64
sleep 0.1
cmd cs_cl_render_trace {out}/explosion-b.txt
wait recorded \d+ lines to .*explosion-b 20
sleep 1
cmd cs_te_fire explosion -4116 4400 64
sleep 0.15
cmd cs_cl_render_trace {out}/explosion-c.txt
wait recorded \d+ lines to .*explosion-c 20
sleep 1
cmd cs_te_fire explosion -4116 4400 64
sleep 0.05
shot explosion
api teleport pos=-3843,2894,0 ang=25,90,0 settle=1
sleep 2
cmd cs_cl_render_trace {out}/pose2.txt
wait recorded \d+ lines to .*pose2 20
shot pose2
api teleport pos=-3800,2500,0 ang=-20,30,0 settle=1
sleep 2
cmd cs_cl_render_trace {out}/pose3.txt
wait recorded \d+ lines to .*pose3 20
shot pose3
cmd map dm_lockdown
sleep 25
cmd sv_cheats 1
cmd cs_sv_showpanel 1 info 0
api teleport pos=-4116,4600,3 ang=0,-90,0 settle=1
sleep 2
cmd cs_cl_render_trace {out}/reload-pose1.txt
wait recorded \d+ lines to .*reload-pose1 60
shot reload-pose1
cmd cs_te_fire explosion -4116 4400 64
sleep 0.05
cmd cs_cl_render_trace {out}/reload-explosion.txt
wait recorded \d+ lines to .*reload-explosion 20
quit
